<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="177217021"/></metadata></head><body dur="3:59.229"><div begin="28.777" end="48.477" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="28.777" end="31.983" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="28.777" end="30.161">跑到哪里</span><span begin="30.161" end="30.817">逛</span><span begin="30.817" end="31.166">一</span><span begin="31.166" end="31.983">逛</span></p><p begin="33.648" end="38.521" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="33.648" end="35.099">才没辜负我</span><span begin="35.099" end="35.949">的</span><span begin="35.949" end="36.306">细</span><span begin="36.306" end="37.671">心打</span><span begin="37.671" end="38.521">扮</span></p><p begin="39.274" end="43.937" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="39.274" end="40.636">买下那渴</span><span begin="40.636" end="41.226">望</span><span begin="41.226" end="41.580">已</span><span begin="41.580" end="42.329">久</span><span begin="42.329" end="42.851">的耳</span><span begin="42.851" end="43.937">环</span></p><p begin="44.426" end="48.477" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="44.426" end="45.777">是否一种</span><span begin="45.777" end="47.758">心理补</span><span begin="47.758" end="48.477">偿</span></p></div><div begin="49.016" end="1:13.352" itunes:songPart="PreChorus"><p begin="49.016" end="55.442" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="49.016" end="49.408">灯</span><span begin="49.408" end="49.565">火</span><span begin="49.565" end="49.888">太</span><span begin="49.888" end="50.136">灿</span><span begin="50.136" end="50.581">烂</span> <span begin="52.059" end="53.595">还是我成绩</span><span begin="53.595" end="54.316">太</span><span begin="54.316" end="54.627">美</span><span begin="54.627" end="55.442">满</span></p><p begin="55.807" end="59.487" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="55.807" end="56.162">好</span><span begin="56.162" end="58.881">想玩个疯</span><span begin="58.881" end="59.487">狂</span></p><p begin="59.497" end="1:05.931" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="59.497" end="59.737">废</span><span begin="59.737" end="59.982">寝</span><span begin="59.982" end="1:00.326">也</span><span begin="1:00.326" end="1:00.446">忘</span><span begin="1:00.446" end="1:01.126">餐</span> <span begin="1:02.446" end="1:03.753">才换到这</span><span begin="1:03.753" end="1:04.688">成</span><span begin="1:04.688" end="1:05.088">就</span><span begin="1:05.088" end="1:05.931">感</span></p><p begin="1:06.312" end="1:13.352" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:06.312" end="1:09.349">可是如果来个烛光晚</span><span begin="1:09.349" end="1:10.053">餐</span> <span begin="1:10.215" end="1:11.525">一个人怎</span><span begin="1:11.525" end="1:12.219">吃</span><span begin="1:12.219" end="1:12.555">得</span><span begin="1:12.555" end="1:13.352">完</span></p></div><div begin="1:13.487" end="1:37.570" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="1:13.487" end="1:16.603" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:13.487" end="1:14.487">我知道</span><span begin="1:14.487" end="1:15.114">怎</span><span begin="1:15.114" end="1:15.545">么</span><span begin="1:15.545" end="1:16.603">办</span></p><p begin="1:16.710" end="1:21.609" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:16.710" end="1:17.182">只来</span><span begin="1:17.182" end="1:18.153">一道甜</span><span begin="1:18.153" end="1:18.723">点</span> <span begin="1:18.723" end="1:19.734">感觉一</span><span begin="1:19.734" end="1:20.411">样</span><span begin="1:20.411" end="1:20.769">浪</span><span begin="1:20.769" end="1:21.609">漫</span></p><p begin="1:21.923" end="1:26.962" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:21.923" end="1:22.390">甜蜜</span><span begin="1:22.390" end="1:24.984">的味道会掩盖所有</span><span begin="1:24.984" end="1:25.811">辛</span><span begin="1:25.811" end="1:26.962">酸</span></p><p begin="1:27.172" end="1:32.044" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:27.172" end="1:27.561">让我</span><span begin="1:27.561" end="1:28.500">感受一</span><span begin="1:28.500" end="1:29.049">下</span> <span begin="1:29.223" end="1:30.207">冰淇淋</span><span begin="1:30.207" end="